{"id": "t08-e1ce32", "status": "read", "groups": [{"levels": [[{"surface": "عبد الله بن منير", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "أبا النضر", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "عبد الرحمن بن عبد الله", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "أبيه", "kind": "relation"}], [{"surface": "أبي صالح", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "أبي هريرة", "kind": "narrator"}]]}], "shared_tail": null, "needs_ruling": false, "notes": ["«سمع أبا النضر» makes him a link. The editor's gloss «يعني ابن دينار» is left out. «عن أبيه» is bare, so it is a relation link. Abu Hurayra is the last link."], "fixes": []}
